---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section text="Achievements & Activities" href="achievements">
  <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
    <article
      class="rounded-2xl border border-primary/15 bg-[#f8f5fc] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md"
    >
      <span class="text-sm font-medium text-primary"> Singapore · 2023 </span>

      <h3 class="mt-3 mb-3 font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-black">
        FIRST Global Robotics Challenge
      </h3>

      <p class="text-base leading-7 text-neutral">
        Represented Namibia in an international robotics competition,
        collaborating with a multidisciplinary team to develop technology-based
        solutions to global challenges.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article
      class="rounded-2xl border border-primary/15 bg-[#f8f5fc] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md"
    >
      <span class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">
        Athens, Greece · 2024
      </span>

      <h3 class="mt-3 mb-3 font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-black">
        FIRST Global Robotics Challenge
      </h3>

      <p class="text-base leading-7 text-neutral">
        Participated in an international robotics competition, applying
        programming, STEM, teamwork, and problem-solving skills in a
        collaborative technical environment.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article
      class="rounded-2xl border border-primary/15 bg-[#f8f5fc] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md md:col-span-2"
    >
      <span class="text-sm font-medium text-primary"> Namibia · 2026 </span>

      <h3 class="mt-3 mb-3 font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-black">
        Deep Learning IndabaX Namibia
      </h3>

      <p class="max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-neutral">
        Participated in a multidisciplinary AI hackathon and contributed to
        VISION, an AI-powered livestock advisory prototype using Python,
        FastAPI, Google Gemini, REST APIs, and environmental data.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Section>
